extensions.reason:
We hereby apply for extension of registration of project ‘Sai Proviso County Project’ situated at Survey No. 153/1, 153/2, 154/1, 188/2, Village Shirdhon, Taluka Panvel, District Raigad registered with the regulatory authority vide project registration certificate bearing no. P517000002042 which has expired on 30th December, 2022.

We are submitting the following documents and information, namely:-
1.	Rupees Two Lakhs Six Thousand Only (Rs.2,06,000/-) as fee for extension as provided under sub-rule (3) of Rule 7;

2.	The construction of the said Project is completed and we have applied for the formal Occupancy Certificate. Authenticated copy of virtual architect completion certificates (i) dated 02/12/2021 for Building No. 1,2,3 & 7, (ii) dated 08/03/2022 for Building No. 4 & 6, (iii) dated 02/05/2022 for Building No. 5 and (iv) dated 23/06/2022 for Building No. 8 are appended herewith as Annexure A-1 to Annexure A-4;

3.	Copy of Application dated 24/06/2022 made for the Occupancy Certificate to CIDCO appended herewith as Annexure B;

4.	We have not yet received formal OC from CIDCO which is expected soon.
